33. FINAL PRODUCT VISION

MOMENTUM should become the user’s central environment for managing life.

When a user opens the application, they should immediately understand:

* What matters today.
* What they need to accomplish.
* Which goals they are progressing toward.
* What they have already achieved.
* What needs their attention.
* What they should focus on next.

The experience should connect daily execution with long-term personal development.

The application should make progress visible without making the user feel guilty for being human.

The ultimate objective is not to make people spend more time inside MOMENTUM.

It is to help them spend their time better outside it.

